    'title' => 'Dysphagia: Evaluation and Management Fundamentals',
    'audience' => 'professionals',
    'level' => 'advanced',
    'short_desc' => 'An advanced course on the physiology of normal swallowing, clinical and instrumental dysphagia assessment, and evidence-based management strategies across the lifespan.',
    'outcomes' => [
