    'short_desc' => 'A clinical course on the anatomy and physiology of voice production, perceptual and instrumental voice assessment, and behavioral therapy approaches for common voice disorders.',
    'outcomes' => [
        'Describe the anatomy and physiology of phonation and identify how common pathologies disrupt normal vocal fold vibration.',
